<section class="nhsuk-section" id="somerset">

    <h2 class="nhsuk-heading-l nhsuk-u-margin-bottom-5">Somerset NHS Foundation Trust</h2>
    <p class="nhsuk-body">Go live date: 23rd January 2025 <br> Sites: Musgrove and Yeovil</p>
    <p class="nhsuk-body">Somerset was the first NHS Trust to introduce the breast self-referral pathway through NHS 111 online, providing eligible patients with a direct digital route into specialist breast diagnostic services without needing to see their GP first. The pilot has provided valuable insights into patient uptake, clinical outcomes, referral activity and the operational requirements of introducing self-referral into existing diagnostic services. Analysis of referral activity indicates that overall demand has remained broadly stable, while an increasing proportion of patients are accessing services through NHS 111 online. The experience and learning from Somerset have helped inform the expansion of the programme to other NHS Trusts.</p>
    <p class="nhsuk-body">Since promoting the pilot service, Somerset has seen a steady decrease in the number of GP referrals, with people self-referring online instead.</p>

