<section class="nhsuk-section" id="manchester">

    <h2 class="nhsuk-heading-l nhsuk-u-margin-bottom-5">Manchester University NHS Foundation Trust</h2>
    <p class="nhsuk-body">Go live date: 2nd June 2026 <br> Sites: North Manchester and Wythenshawe</p>
    <p class="nhsuk-body">Manchester University NHS Foundation Trust adopted a phased approach to introducing breast self-referral through NHS 111 online, initially making the service available to eligible patients within a defined geographical area, with plans to expand coverage over time.</p>
    <p class="nhsuk-body">The Trust worked closely with Greater Manchester Cancer Alliance and the NHS 111 online team throughout onboarding, with dedicated local leadership helping to coordinate stakeholders and support implementation.</p>

    <div class="nhsuk-grid-row">
        <ul class="nhsuk-grid-row">
            <li class=" nhsuk-card-group__item">
                <div class="nhsuk-card">
                    <div class="nhsuk-card__content">
                        <p class="nhsuk-body-s" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-style: italic; color: #005EB8">“We are delighted to be among the first units to participate in this project and are excited about the opportunity to improve access and support earlier diagnosis for our communities in Manchester. Throughout the on-boarding process, we formed a strong partnership between Trust colleagues, NHS111 and the Greater Manchester Cancer Alliance, which enabled us to deliver a safe, step-wise launch of online self-referral. We found that having a dedicated local project lead was essential to coordinate stakeholders and maintain momentum. The Cancer Alliance has also been central to supporting the launch and regional communications, while also providing wider system oversight and supporting further expansion. We feel this combination of strong local leadership and Cancer Alliance support will be key to maintaining momentum and embedding the pathway for the long term.”</p>
                        <p class="nhsuk-body-s" style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Speciality Registrar in Breast Surgery & Cancer Clinical Leadership Fellow <br> Manchester Foundation Trust</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </div>

</section>